{
  "dialogue_id": "Dialogue7_1",
  "total_duration_s": 62.05,
  "sample_rate": 32000,
  "turns_count": 10,
  "turns": [
    {
      "turn_idx": 1,
      "speaker": "A",
      "voice": "female_v4",
      "text": "工作忙了一整天，大家肚子都饿了吧，咱们先看看这家餐馆的菜单。",
      "start_ms": 0.0,
      "end_ms": 5656.0,
      "duration_ms": 5656.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 2,
      "speaker": "B",
      "voice": "male_v1",
      "text": "服务员，请给我们拿一份最新的菜单，顺便上一壶热龙井茶。",
      "start_ms": 6176.0,
      "end_ms": 12382.0,
      "duration_ms": 6206.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 3,
      "speaker": "C",
      "voice": "male_zs",
      "text": "你们有什么忌口的吗？这家店以地道的特色川菜而闻名。",
      "start_ms": 12902.0,
      "end_ms": 18193.0,
      "duration_ms": 5291.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 4,
      "speaker": "A",
      "voice": "female_v4",
      "text": "我不太能吃特别辣的菜，不知道他们有没有清淡一点的家常菜推荐？",
      "start_ms": 18713.0,
      "end_ms": 23829.0,
      "duration_ms": 5116.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 5,
      "speaker": "B",
      "voice": "male_v1",
      "text": "我看这里的清蒸鲈鱼和番茄炒蛋很受欢迎，味道鲜美，一点都不辣。",
      "start_ms": 24449.0,
      "end_ms": 31705.0,
      "duration_ms": 7256.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 6,
      "speaker": "C",
      "voice": "male_zs",
      "text": "再点一份宫保鸡丁和干煸四季豆吧，微辣爽口，尝起来很有滋味。",
      "start_ms": 32225.0,
      "end_ms": 39221.0,
      "duration_ms": 6996.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 7,
      "speaker": "A",
      "voice": "female_v4",
      "text": "主食我们点三碗香米饭，喝的大家想要茶水还是鲜榨果汁？",
      "start_ms": 39741.0,
      "end_ms": 44687.0,
      "duration_ms": 4946.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 8,
      "speaker": "B",
      "voice": "male_v1",
      "text": "喝热茶就挺好的，既解油腻，又能放松身心。",
      "start_ms": 45307.0,
      "end_ms": 50243.0,
      "duration_ms": 4936.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 9,
      "speaker": "C",
      "voice": "male_zs",
      "text": "好，那咱们现在就把这几道菜定下来，让后厨尽快下锅烹饪。",
      "start_ms": 50763.0,
      "end_ms": 56604.0,
      "duration_ms": 5841.0
    },
    {
      "turn_idx": 10,
      "speaker": "A",
      "voice": "female_v4",
      "text": "看着图片就很有食欲，今天这顿丰盛的晚餐一定会非常愉快！",
      "start_ms": 57124.0,
      "end_ms": 62045.0,
      "duration_ms": 4921.0
    }
  ]
}